<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Highveld to detail cap award March 10.</title>
<headline>Highveld to detail cap award March 10.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Highveld steel and Vanadium Corp Ltd said it would announce the basis of a capitalisation award in lieu of the cash dividend on March 10.</p>
<p>The record date for the award and the right of election to receive the final cash dividend instead is March 14 with pay date April 23.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
